# Lyna, Veil of Vengeance: "Shadow. Whenever a creature you control with shadow deals combat damage to a player, draw a card.
# {3}: Put a shadow counter on another target creature. Activate only as a sorcery."
# On turn 3 Lyna's ability puts a shadow counter on Bot1's Cecil, Dark Knight, which has shadow by it (CR 122.1b). Lyna and
# Cecil attack. Bot2's Embereth Shieldbreaker can't block Cecil (shadow, CR 702.28b); Bot2's Dauthi Voidwalker, with shadow,
# may block, and blocks Lyna (the positive control). Cecil deals Bot2 2 and Bot1 draws a card for it; Darkness makes Bot1 lose
# the 2 Cecil dealt. Lyna and the Voidwalker kill each other, and the Voidwalker exiles Lyna instead of letting it go to
# Bot1's graveyard. Bot1 holds the Island it kept, the card it drew on turn 3 and the one Lyna drew: 3.

